{"id":5879,"date":"2021-03-05T14:44:47","date_gmt":"2021-03-05T13:44:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5879"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:01:49","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:01:49","slug":"flexhop-bientot-sur-la-2eme-couronne-de-lems","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/flexhop-bientot-sur-la-2eme-couronne-de-lems\/","title":{"rendered":"Flex&rsquo;hop, vos trajets dans l&rsquo;EMS \u00e0 la carte sur r\u00e9servation"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Depuis le\u00a01er mars, les v\u00e9hiculent Flex\u2019hop circulent dans une zone \u00e9largie \u00e0 l\u2019ensemble des communes de la seconde couronne de l&rsquo;EMS. La r\u00e9servation s\u2019effectue\u00a0sur\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/cts-strasbourg.eu\">cts-strasbourg.eu<\/a><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><strong>Cr\u00e9ez votre espace<\/strong> pour acc\u00e9der au service de<strong> transport en commun sur r\u00e9servation<\/strong> qui vient compl\u00e9ter l\u2019offre de transport existante vers les zones d\u2019activit\u00e9s et industrielles et vers le c\u0153ur de l\u2019agglom\u00e9ration\u00a0<strong>au tarif CTS habituel.\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Flex\u2019hop fonctionne <strong>tous les jours (sauf 1er mai), de 5h \u00e0 minuit<\/strong>, sur le principe <strong>d\u2019une r\u00e9servation obligatoire effectu\u00e9e de 15 jours \u00e0 30 minutes avant le d\u00e9part<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>La mont\u00e9e et la descente se font depuis <strong>tous les arr\u00eats CTS et les arr\u00eats Fluo Grand Est 67<\/strong> des communes concern\u00e9es.<\/p>\n<p><em>Les r\u00e9servations seront possibles<strong>\u00a0via :<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>le site<\/strong> :\u00a0<a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/reservation.cts-strasbourg.eu\/login\" target=\"_blank\" data-ajax=\"false\" rel=\"noopener\">www.flexhop.eu<\/a>\u00a0(24h\/24 et 7j\/7) ;<\/li>\n<li><strong>la centrale t\u00e9l\u00e9phonique<\/strong>\u00a0en appelant le\u00a0<strong><a class=\"\" href=\"tel:0 800 200 120\" data-ajax=\"false\">0 800 200 120<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0appel gratuit, du lundi au samedi de 6h \u00e0 20h, et les dimanches et jours f\u00e9ri\u00e9s (sauf 1er mai) de 9h \u00e0 20h ;<\/li>\n<li><strong>l&rsquo;appli CTS<\/strong>\u00a0:\u00a0<strong>Flex&rsquo;hop <\/strong>(24h\/24 et 7j\/7) <a href=\"https:\/\/flex-hop.fr.aptoide.com\/app\">Andro\u00efde<\/a> ou <a href=\"https:\/\/apps.apple.com\/fr\/app\/flexhop-le-tad-de-la-cts\/id1484796610\">iPhone<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A.jpeg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5881\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"682\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A.jpeg 650w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A-286x300.jpeg 286w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A-300x315.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A-105x110.jpeg 105w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/62D99EF1-CB6D-498A-BAA8-330FD509020A-127x133.jpeg 127w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Depuis le\u00a01er mars, les v\u00e9hiculent Flex\u2019hop circulent dans une zone \u00e9largie \u00e0 l\u2019ensemble des communes de la seconde couronne de l&rsquo;EMS. La r\u00e9servation s\u2019effectue\u00a0sur\u00a0cts-strasbourg.eu<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-d